==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Because the only enemies in this stage are Firework Guys, no strategy is required whatsoever. This is nigh-impossible to lose; anything works.

Although this stage is the easiest in the entire game, it is very hard to access: it is only available on the 2nd and 22nd day of each month, and only for 2 minutes, starting at 2:22pm and ending at 2:24. Additionally, having beaten [[Into the Future]]'s 3rd chapter is a requirement.

==Trivia==
*This is the only non-event Special Cat [[:Category:Awakening Stages|Awakening]] stage that doesn't have the Cat counterpart as an enemy appearing in the stage.

